{"id":"pilot-v1-h264-01","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"intra4x4-dc","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"avc-intra4x4-dc-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.264 的一个亮度 4×4 块已经选中 Intra_4x4_DC。上、左各有 4 个候选参考样本，可用性也已判定。哪些情况使用两边、单边或位深中点？这个预测会在 4×4 块内随坐标变化吗？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"先分别判断上边 4 个和左边 4 个是否完整可用。两边都完整时对 8 个样本作舍入平均；仅一边完整时只对该边 4 个样本作舍入平均；两边都不完整时用 2^(BitDepthY−1)。整个 4×4 块的 16 个预测样本取同一个值，不混用两条不完整边的剩余样本。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":162},"snippet_sha256":"723a970e86212e8557a6c339c59b19b9742538f08a67b9bf9decd67bdcf4ec70"},{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":163},"snippet_sha256":"61a0a115b6a6267f0aa5f6eefaab7bbb58b292b35c894605d827b3b48cdc4b36"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h264-02","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"intra4x4-dc","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"avc-intra4x4-dc-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.264 8-bit 亮度块使用 Intra_4x4_DC，上边 [10,20,30,40]、左边 [50,60,70,84] 全部可用。求任一个预测样本的值，并说明舍入。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 dc。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"8 个参考样本和为 364。两边都可用时先加 4 再右移 3 位：(364+4)>>3=46，因此整块的预测值为 46。\n{\"dc\":46}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":162},"snippet_sha256":"723a970e86212e8557a6c339c59b19b9742538f08a67b9bf9decd67bdcf4ec70"},{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":163},"snippet_sha256":"61a0a115b6a6267f0aa5f6eefaab7bbb58b292b35c894605d827b3b48cdc4b36"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h264-03","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"intra4x4-dc","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"avc-intra4x4-dc-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.264 10-bit 亮度 Intra_4x4_DC。A：上边 [17, 不可用, 18, 不可用]，左边 [19,20,20,23] 完整可用。B：保持上边不变，左边最后一个 23 也不可用。求 A、B 的常量预测值。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 dc_a、dc_b。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"A 只有左边完整，用 (19+20+20+23+2)>>2=21。B 上、左都不完整，使用 1<<(10−1)=512；不对散落的可用样本另算平均。\n{\"dc_a\":21,\"dc_b\":512}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":162},"snippet_sha256":"723a970e86212e8557a6c339c59b19b9742538f08a67b9bf9decd67bdcf4ec70"},{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":163},"snippet_sha256":"61a0a115b6a6267f0aa5f6eefaab7bbb58b292b35c894605d827b3b48cdc4b36"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h264-04","codecs":["h264"],"topic":"intra4x4-dc","task_type":"source_code","split_group":"avc-intra4x4-dc-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"在固定 x264 快照的标量代码里，predict_4x4_dc_128_c 把 1<<(BIT_DEPTH-1) 经 PIXEL_SPLAT_X4 展开后交给填充宏；宏写入四行、每行四像素。函数名中的 128 是否意味着 10-bit 构建时仍填 128？说明函数的实际输出。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不是。常量由编译位深决定；10-bit 时是 512，8-bit 时才是 128。展开后的同一值写到四行的每个像素，得到 16 个相同的预测样本。这是该快照的标量回退实现。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":162},"snippet_sha256":"723a970e86212e8557a6c339c59b19b9742538f08a67b9bf9decd67bdcf4ec70"},{"source_id":"h264-spec","source_revision":"028cf2cfefd6083ced98d3acb0b586d9328e1631c13d6f21057ad54c569b1b79","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":163},"snippet_sha256":"61a0a115b6a6267f0aa5f6eefaab7bbb58b292b35c894605d827b3b48cdc4b36"},{"source_id":"x264-code","source_revision":"0480cb05fa188d37ae87e8f4fd8f1aea3711f7ee","locator":{"type":"file_lines","path":"common/predict.c","start":475,"end":484},"snippet_sha256":"8bd51900d43cb49e634e13dc5aac5b088e4870801819c65a06fed8caee97c653"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"code","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h265-01","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"merge-candidate-list","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"hevc-merge-list-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"在基础 HEVC 帧间 merge 预测中，一个预测块采用 merge 且有效 merge_idx=1。这个 1 是参考图像列表的 ref_idx，还是 merge 候选列表中的索引？MaxNumMergeCand 又能否直接告诉你有多少个可用空间邻块？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"1 是当前预测块 merge 候选列表的索引，选择第二个候选。候选承载参考列表使用标记、对应参考索引和运动矢量等预测信息，所以 merge_idx 不是 ref_idx。MaxNumMergeCand 描述该 slice 的 merge 列表上限，不是实际可用空间邻块数；列表还可能由非空间候选及零运动候选补足。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":116},"snippet_sha256":"377d040c66fcfc3fb346a4c944bee6ec17690af83661fa742ce2b636d20c0c9b"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":126},"snippet_sha256":"1d1c16f88a8587b0b75d32452412b79c2d2be37e36e90ca4b0acdc7392c91652"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":168},"snippet_sha256":"cff4c3cebe06fd26533050c039a4b8d27bcfb2730544edeb67db87111cafe351"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h265-02","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"merge-candidate-list","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"hevc-merge-list-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"基础单层 HEVC 的 P slice 中 five_minus_max_num_merge_cand=2。对一个已进入 merge 分支的预测块，求 MaxNumMergeCand 和最大的合法 merge_idx，并给出 merge_idx 是否存在（1 表示存在，0 表示不传输）。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 max_num_merge_cand、max_merge_idx、merge_idx_present。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"MaxNumMergeCand=5−2=3，零起始的候选索引是 0、1、2，最大值为 2。因为已进入 merge 分支且候选上限大于 1，需传输 merge_idx。\n{\"max_num_merge_cand\":3,\"max_merge_idx\":2,\"merge_idx_present\":1}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":116},"snippet_sha256":"377d040c66fcfc3fb346a4c944bee6ec17690af83661fa742ce2b636d20c0c9b"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":73},"snippet_sha256":"0c5cdcefda4458ad5939674e2b84ab91bad85770269db788c249c802b3ec15c2"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":126},"snippet_sha256":"1d1c16f88a8587b0b75d32452412b79c2d2be37e36e90ca4b0acdc7392c91652"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h265-03","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"merge-candidate-list","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"hevc-merge-list-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"基础单层 HEVC 的 P slice 中 five_minus_max_num_merge_cand=4。当前预测块已选 merge。求候选上限和最大有效 merge_idx；如果该字段不出现，说明解码器推断的索引。字段存在用 1 表示，不传输用 0 表示。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 max_num_merge_cand、max_merge_idx、merge_idx_present。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"候选上限为 5−4=1，唯一的有效索引是 0。语法只在候选上限大于 1 时传输 merge_idx；这里字段不出现，解码器推断为 0。\n{\"max_num_merge_cand\":1,\"max_merge_idx\":0,\"merge_idx_present\":0}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":116},"snippet_sha256":"377d040c66fcfc3fb346a4c944bee6ec17690af83661fa742ce2b636d20c0c9b"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":73},"snippet_sha256":"0c5cdcefda4458ad5939674e2b84ab91bad85770269db788c249c802b3ec15c2"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":126},"snippet_sha256":"1d1c16f88a8587b0b75d32452412b79c2d2be37e36e90ca4b0acdc7392c91652"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h265-04","codecs":["h265"],"topic":"merge-candidate-list","task_type":"source_code","split_group":"hevc-merge-list-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"固定 HM 快照的 TDecSbac::parseMergeIndex 把索引从 0 开始计数，最多读取 numCand−1 个 bin。第一个用上下文解码，随后用 bypass；读到 0 就在当前索引停止。设 numCand=4，依次解得的 bin 值为 1、1、0。输出索引是多少？三个 bin 分别走哪条解码路径？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"返回 2：前两个 1 让索引从 0 增到 1、再增到 2，第三个 0 使循环在 2 停止。第一个 bin 用上下文模型，第二、第三个用 bypass。这里说的是解出的 bin 序列，不是直接从码流读取的三个裸比特。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":73},"snippet_sha256":"0c5cdcefda4458ad5939674e2b84ab91bad85770269db788c249c802b3ec15c2"},{"source_id":"h265-spec","source_revision":"78b093480e178a2b99d8cb7499934240f359c50c6d09568f8be651bc1151d4d2","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":126},"snippet_sha256":"1d1c16f88a8587b0b75d32452412b79c2d2be37e36e90ca4b0acdc7392c91652"},{"source_id":"hm-code","source_revision":"92d95ddd2995d0ae3149d3dac1e573e96460b821","locator":{"type":"file_lines","path":"source/Lib/TLibDecoder/TDecSbac.cpp","start":471,"end":497},"snippet_sha256":"1cdb04e3cddf291313673ae698cc25e683dd0beec12913bb0c706054ad8117c5"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"code","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h266-01","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"poc-msb-derivation","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"vvc-poc-msb-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.266 的图像顺序计数（POC）派生中，显式出现 ph_poc_msb_cycle_val、未出现且当前图像为 CLVSS、未出现且非 CLVSS 三种情况，如何确定 PicOrderCntMsb？什么时候需要上一参考锚点？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"显式周期存在时，用周期值乘 MaxPicOrderCntLsb。该字段缺失且当前为 CLVSS 时，高位为 0。缺失且非 CLVSS 时，才用标准选定的 prevTid0Pic 的高低位和当前 LSB 作回绕判断。最终 POC 等于派生的高位加当前 LSB；历史锚点不能随意取上一张解码图像。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":203},"snippet_sha256":"9cf56fb62d6498d6f49086e10a311077ccc82aff5749d07f774b284300cc0833"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":204},"snippet_sha256":"fa6cef526aeb4279f65a8e65e5d2b7116c3a4674d856fe98eda96291f9e7bf3b"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h266-02","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"poc-msb-derivation","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"vvc-poc-msb-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.266 当前图像非 CLVSS，没有显式 POC MSB 周期。已按规范选定 prevTid0Pic：prevPicOrderCntMsb=512、prevPicOrderCntLsb=240。MaxPicOrderCntLsb=256，当前 ph_pic_order_cnt_lsb=8。求当前 PicOrderCntMsb 与完整 POC。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 poc_msb、poc。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"当前低位从 240 降到 8，差 232，达到向前回绕阈值 128，所以当前高位增加一个周期：512+256=768。加上当前低位 8 得 POC=776；它相对上一锚点 752 只前进 24。\n{\"poc_msb\":768,\"poc\":776}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":203},"snippet_sha256":"9cf56fb62d6498d6f49086e10a311077ccc82aff5749d07f774b284300cc0833"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":204},"snippet_sha256":"fa6cef526aeb4279f65a8e65e5d2b7116c3a4674d856fe98eda96291f9e7bf3b"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h266-03","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"poc-msb-derivation","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"vvc-poc-msb-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"H.266 题设已确认 ph_poc_msb_cycle_val 合法且显式存在，值为 3。MaxPicOrderCntLsb=256，当前 ph_pic_order_cnt_lsb=19。求 PicOrderCntMsb 和完整 POC。是否还需要用前图 LSB 决定回绕？最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 poc_msb、poc。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"高位直接由显式周期得出：3×256=768；完整 POC=768+19=787。本分支不再用前图低位判断是否回绕。\n{\"poc_msb\":768,\"poc\":787}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":203},"snippet_sha256":"9cf56fb62d6498d6f49086e10a311077ccc82aff5749d07f774b284300cc0833"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":204},"snippet_sha256":"fa6cef526aeb4279f65a8e65e5d2b7116c3a4674d856fe98eda96291f9e7bf3b"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-h266-04","codecs":["h266"],"topic":"poc-msb-derivation","task_type":"source_code","split_group":"vvc-poc-msb-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"固定 VTM 快照的非 IDR、无显式周期路径先用 prevTid0POC & (maxPocLsb−1) 得前图低位，再用减法取前图高位。若当前低位大于前图低位且差严格大于半周期，就从前图高位减一个周期。给定 prevTid0POC=522、maxPocLsb=256、当前低位=250，解释该段代码得到的当前 POC。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"522 拆为高位 512、低位 10。当前低位比前图大 240，超过 128，代码将高位减为 256，再加 250 得到 506。完整 POC 相对 522 小 16；仅比较裸 LSB 方向会得到相反判断。这是所给 VTM 分支的结果。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":203},"snippet_sha256":"9cf56fb62d6498d6f49086e10a311077ccc82aff5749d07f774b284300cc0833"},{"source_id":"h266-spec","source_revision":"ec728a475ffbf741f530bc9bca2422092dc7cbc60ebac5f72807c202c8740f25","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":204},"snippet_sha256":"fa6cef526aeb4279f65a8e65e5d2b7116c3a4674d856fe98eda96291f9e7bf3b"},{"source_id":"vtm-code","source_revision":"010584cf75dd0b61bd6295d7eacf20975094aac4","locator":{"type":"file_lines","path":"source/Lib/DecoderLib/VLCReader.cpp","start":4519,"end":4544},"snippet_sha256":"2cc4423ebaf3bbb9c61cc75011656ce80ad3764e6333264ae6a80b42439cfadf"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"code","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-av1-01","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"superres-width","task_type":"explanation","split_group":"av1-superres-width-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"AV1 的 superres_params 在更新 FrameWidth 前保存 UpscaledWidth。如果序列头 enable_superres=0，会读取 use_superres 或 coded_denom 吗？执行 render_size() 且未单独传输显示尺寸时，RenderWidth 默认取哪一个宽度？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"序列关闭 superres 时，不读取 use_superres，而把它推断为 0；也不读取 coded_denom，分母取 8，横向尺寸为 1:1。UpscaledWidth 保存缩放前传入的目标宽度，FrameWidth 是 superres 处理后用于编码尺寸的宽度。对题设的 render_size() 默认分支，RenderWidth 取 UpscaledWidth。显式显示尺寸是另一条语法路径。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":27},"snippet_sha256":"7b45a64dc0b329dff00cf997677cca04489a54a0e49ae027d8c176b40b17fbb1"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":56},"snippet_sha256":"10dbe3871d26397595ddc62e23a5bbc14fb8944d0db51a921fe5977f815d6414"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":57},"snippet_sha256":"1109dc3e3372e986b90ee4e9e93890f159cc3bfe1be24af49bab009798b23e24"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-av1-02","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"superres-width","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"av1-superres-width-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"AV1 已启用并对当前帧使用 superres，coded_denom=3，进入该过程前 FrameWidth=1920、FrameHeight=1080。求 SuperresDenom，以及派生后的 FrameWidth 和 FrameHeight。题设尺寸满足其他符合性约束。最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 superres_denom、frame_width、frame_height。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"分母是 9+3=12。保存 UpscaledWidth=1920 后，宽度用整数除法 (1920×8+6)//12=1280。该过程不缩放高度，所以 FrameHeight=1080。\n{\"superres_denom\":12,\"frame_width\":1280,\"frame_height\":1080}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":27},"snippet_sha256":"7b45a64dc0b329dff00cf997677cca04489a54a0e49ae027d8c176b40b17fbb1"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":56},"snippet_sha256":"10dbe3871d26397595ddc62e23a5bbc14fb8944d0db51a921fe5977f815d6414"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":57},"snippet_sha256":"1109dc3e3372e986b90ee4e9e93890f159cc3bfe1be24af49bab009798b23e24"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-av1-03","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"superres-width","task_type":"calculation","split_group":"av1-superres-width-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"AV1 当前帧采用 superres，coded_denom=0，进入过程前宽度为 1921、高度为 1080，假设配置及尺寸均允许。求分母与派生尺寸。若有人直接把 1921×8/9 向下取整，他的结果哪里不同？最后一行输出整数 JSON，键为 superres_denom、frame_width、frame_height。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"分母为 9。规范在除法前加上整数的 9//2=4，宽度为 (1921×8+4)//9=1708；直接截断只得 1707。高度仍为 1080。这里算的是编码宽度，不是保存的 UpscaledWidth=1921。\n{\"superres_denom\":9,\"frame_width\":1708,\"frame_height\":1080}"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":27},"snippet_sha256":"7b45a64dc0b329dff00cf997677cca04489a54a0e49ae027d8c176b40b17fbb1"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":56},"snippet_sha256":"10dbe3871d26397595ddc62e23a5bbc14fb8944d0db51a921fe5977f815d6414"},{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":57},"snippet_sha256":"1109dc3e3372e986b90ee4e9e93890f159cc3bfe1be24af49bab009798b23e24"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"calculation","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/verification-report.json"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
{"id":"pilot-v1-av1-04","codecs":["av1"],"topic":"superres-width","task_type":"source_code","split_group":"av1-superres-width-family","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"固定 libaom 快照的 resize.c 有两个函数：av1_calculate_scaled_size 分别把 width 和 height 传给尺寸 helper；av1_calculate_scaled_superres_size 只把 width 传给 helper，height 未使用。能否因为两者复用了 helper，就用前一个替代后一个处理 superres？说明差异。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"不能作为一般替代。普通尺寸函数对两个维度执行 helper；superres 专用函数只处理宽度，保持调用者提供的高度不变。两者共用的舍入逻辑不代表调用范围相同；分母非 1:1 时尤其可能因替换而错误改变高度。"}],"evidence":[{"source_id":"av1-spec-pdf","source_revision":"ec44e9fc42c4e5851faa879a1818dcb9014d834bbdd9420ccca7dcea05a3abe9","locator":{"type":"pdf_page","page":57},"snippet_sha256":"1109dc3e3372e986b90ee4e9e93890f159cc3bfe1be24af49bab009798b23e24"},{"source_id":"libaom-code","source_revision":"8a1038536cde81c548341145f40d6dfddc3077d6","locator":{"type":"file_lines","path":"av1/common/resize.c","start":1273,"end":1300},"snippet_sha256":"f5349fc3b24cbe0f7bc1a754b654ac2cbd0d686e81273c328b22e598c10664d0"}],"generation":{"model":"Codex","revision":"unknown","prompt_version":"pilot-v1-source-grounded","created_at":"2026-11-11"},"verification":{"status":"pending","checks":[{"kind":"evidence","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"conditions","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"},{"kind":"code","result":"passed","artifact":"datasets/pilot-v1/source-review.md"}],"reviewer":null,"reviewed_at":null},"eligibility":{"status":"pending","note":"自写题面和释义；已完成本批来源及适用条件核对，待独立领域复核与入训使用条件确认。"}}
